{"strongs": "H5795", "word": "עֵז", "translit": "ez", "root": "עז", "morph": "H:N-F", "pos": "noun feminine", "gloss": "kid(s) of she-goats", "definition": "עֵז 74 noun feminine Gen 15:9 she-goat ; — absolute ׳ ע Gen 15:9 + 6 t.; plural עַזִּים Gen 27:9 + 65 t.; suffix עִזֶּיךָ Gen 31:38 — 1. as property Gen 30:32 ; Gen 30:33 ; Gen 30:35 ( J ), Gen 31:15 ; Gen 31:38 ( E ), 1Sam 25:2 . 2. as food: גְּדָיֵי (גְּדִי) עִזִּים kid(s) of she-goats Gen 27:9 ; Gen 27:16 ( J ) + 7 t., שְׂעִיר עִזִּים Gen 37:31 ( J ) a buck of goats, he-goat , שֵׂה עִזִּים Deut 14:4 a (n individual) goat ; compare Lev 7:23 ( P ; fat forbidden); also ׳ חֲלֵב ע Prov 27:27 goats' milk. 3. as sacrificial victim, chiefly P : \\ \\ a. in general Lev 22:27 ( H ), Num 15:11 . \\ \\ b. in בְּרִית Gen 15:9 ( J E ; compare v Gen 15:18 ). \\ \\ c. פֶּסַח Exod 12:5 ( שֶׂה ), בְּנֵי עִזִּים 2Chr 35:7 . \\ \\ d. עוֺלָה Lev 22:19 ( H ), Lev 1:10 ; Num 28:30 ( ׳ שְׂעִיר ע ). \\ \\ e. זֶבַח שְׁלָמִים Lev 3:12 ; Lev 17:3 ( H ; compare v Lev 17:5 ), אִשֶּׁה Num 18:17 ( ׳ בְּכוֺר ע ). feminine חַטָּאת , ׳ שְׂעִיר ע Ezek 43:22 ; Ezek 45:23 ; Lev 4:23 + 3 t. Leviticus; Num 7:16 + 19 t. Numbers; שְׂעִירַת עִזִּים a single she-goat Lev 4:28 ; Lev 5:6 עְפִרֵי זִּים 2Chr 29:21 he-goats. 4. עִזִּים = goats' hair, as material 1Sam 19:13 ; 1Sam 19:16 ; Exod 25:4 + 6 t. P ( Exod 35:26 object of טָווּ !). 5. in simile חֲשַׂפֵי עִזִּים 1Kgs 20:27 (see [ חָשִׂיף ]); ׳ כְּעֵדַר הָע Song 4:1 ; Song 6:5 , of flowing, undulating hair. 6. ׳ צְפִיר הָע Du Song 8:5 ; Song 8:8 he-goat in vision.", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB6220')\">BDB6220</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H5795')\">H5795</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB6219')\">BDB6219</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB6221')\">BDB6221</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>עֵז</bdbheb><sub>74</sub> <b>noun feminine</b><sup><ref ref=\"Gen 15:9\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"15\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"15\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(1,15,